Target: `1 2 3 4 5`
Swaps:
- (1,2) -> 2 1 3 4 5 (No)
- (2,3) -> 1 3 2 4 5 (No)
- (3,4) -> 1 2 4 3 5 (No)
- (4,5) -> 1 2 3 5 4 (No)
Output: No.

